        "Background": "A wealthy, womanizing pop idol, Daisuke rudely dismissed an elderly fan who asked for an autograph — and she cursed him on the spot. Now any woman's amorous touch turns him into a handsome black rabbit until he escapes her sight, clothes and all left behind. Chastened but hardly reformed, he's determined to track the old woman down and get the curse lifted.",
